  "authored_scope": "Supported: grids 18-30 per side by default and 16-30 explicitly; all sizes other than 30x30 are synthetic extensions. Divider layouts are straight (full row/column, train 1 and both tests) and corner/L-shaped (train 2), with the legend on any of the four edges. A corner can sit at either end of its edge, giving 8 corner orientations. Each scene has 2-4 keys with distinct hole counts 0-6, using the fixture key template (3-thick bar with single-cell holes) and distinct colours from {1,2,3,4,6,7,8,9}; colour 1 keys are allowed. Each scene has 4-8 irregular eroded grey blobs (up to 10 explicitly) with hole counts 0-6, and every key count appears on at least one blob. Near-miss distractor blobs, which get erased, are included. Explicit controls are width, height, side, key_holes, key_colours, blob_holes and divider. Deliberately not supported: non-template key shapes (all fixture keys use the bar template), multiple dividers, non-zero background, keys that are not hole-count distinct, single-key legends, and corner scenes with 0-hole blobs but no 0-hole key, because there the L divider would be an ambiguous 0-hole colour-1 'key'. Fixture replay uses input_grid decomposition because the hand-drawn blobs are impractical to write as latent arguments.",
  "authored_constraints": [
    "Key hole counts are pairwise distinct and there are always at least 2 keys.",
    "Every key hole count appears on at least one grey blob.",
    "Blob hole counts agree under 4- and 8-connectivity of the background, and blobs are 4-connected.",
    "Blob bounding boxes are pairwise separated by at least one blank cell, and are kept one blank cell clear of the divider/legend bounding region. No bounding box contains a foreign object.",
    "Keys never touch the divider or the grid border. The divider always touches the border.",
    "A straight divider spans a full row/column. Neither arm of an L divider spans the full grid, and an L divider has 0 holes.",
    "In corner-divider scenes, 0-hole grey blobs exist only if a 0-hole key exists (corner ambiguity guard).",
    "Background 0 covers more than half the grid.",
    "A 0-hole blob has at least 6 cells, so blob size does not reveal hole count.",
    "Explicit parameters are feasibility-checked up front and inconsistent requests raise ValueError. All sampling loops are bounded."
  ],
